    <h1>
      
        Northern Territory Mineral Titles
        
        
      
    </h1>
    
    <div class="notes embedded-content">
      <p>The Department of Mining and Energy stores and manages current and historical mining tenure data within the Northern Territory jurisdiction as part of the provisions of the Mineral Titles Act, Petroleum Act, Energy Pipelines Act, Geothermal Energy Act, and, where applicable, the Commonwealth Aboriginal Land Rights (Northern Territory) Act 1976 (ALRA) and the Native Title Act 1993. Data includes spatial boundaries for all current tenure, tenure application and transactions affecting that tenure.</p>
    </div>
  

  


  
    

